+  <sect1 id="extend-pkg-config">
+   <title>postgresql-&majorversion;-llvm-jit-bitcode.pc</title>
+
+   <para>
+    When <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> is built with
+    <productname>Meson</productname>, it installs a
